---
description: Module and feature structure and layering
globs: apps/web/src/modules/**/*
---

Hierarchy: `modules/<module>/{module.ts,public.ts,shared,features/<feature>}`; a feature is
`{index.ts,api,hooks,model,views/{pages,components},routes,locales}`. Features never nest.

Layering (see the import matrix in `CONVENTIONS.md`):

- `views`: UI + hooks + model only; no `api/`, `fetch`, `apiClient`, `axios` (FE-LAY001/005)
- `hooks`: TanStack Query via `useApi()`; no JSX, no `views` imports (FE-LAY002)
- `api`: HTTP + tenant-scoped keys factory (`all(tenantId)` first); no React/hooks/views (FE-LAY003)
- `model`: zod schemas, constants, mappers; pure TS (FE-LAY004)
- `routes`: path + `permission` + search validation; no business logic (FE-RBAC001)
- `locales`: all copy, `en` and `ja` in sync
- `index.ts`: `defineFeature({ id, routes, nav, locales })`; `module.ts`: `defineModule({ ..., features })`

Boundaries:

- Other features: import only their `index.ts` (FE-IMPORT001)
- Other modules: import only their `public.ts` (FE-STR012)
- Pages use `ListPage` / `DetailPage` / `FormPage` + `QueryState`
- Colocate `*.test.ts[x]`; use `TestProviders` from `@aham/ui-kit/testing`
